<title>GERMANY: Schenker Polska gains IATA sales licence.</title>
<headline>Schenker Polska gains IATA sales licence.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freight forwarder Schenker Polska will be able to offer more air cargo services after obtaining an International Air Transport Association(IATA) sales licence, parent company Schenker-Rhenus AG said.</p>
<p>Schenker Polska has built up a strong market position as a logistics supplier for the automotive industry, a statement said.</p>
<p>The company had five offices in Poland including the port of Gydnia for sea transport and handles road and rail to both western and eastern Europe, it added.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706; Fax: 5017</p>
